# Everything that builds the shipped data but isn't part of the site:
# local/scripts/ (the build scripts), local/data/ (their source tables and
# the Archives of Nethys download cache), local/partial/ (smoke-test
# output). One directory, one rule — these used to be three scattered
# entries, which made it easy to lose track of what was ignored and why.
#
# What these scripts PRODUCE is tracked, not ignored: static/*-data/*.json
# is served to the browser and has to be in the repo for GitHub Pages.
local/
